THE HF-PLUS-WAB FEASIBILITY ASSESSMENT (hf_wab.py, stream l3feas, MESHSAT-1357). PROTOTYPE DESIGN: nothing built, powered
or measured. MODELED on a1elec's energy_two_pack.py through energy_basis.py's set-up (pinned), on the CORRECTED PATH (case
(iii), HYPOTHETICAL: every correction of r11dep's R11-DEPENDENCY.md assumed closed). The author's analysis, AI arithmetic;
not a qualified review and not the independent check. Nothing is designed and no target is picked.

